{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3612670/extras/Love_Surge_Intro.gif?t=1742897019\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>About</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Everyone has a connection to their electronics\u2026 but not everyone has a romantic one. Love Surge! is a visual novel, comedy dating sim, where you can romance human versions of your appliances: Noki (cell phone), Lotte (coffee machine), and Celci (thermostat). </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">When going on dates, the gameplay merges the visual novel text with card game mechanics, to rack up point combos and simulate deeper conversations! This game combines the genres of dating sim, visual novel, and deck builder for one epic adventure!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3612670/extras/LS_Meet_Your_Dates.gif?t=1742897019\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Celci</strong> (Thermostat)</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Likes: <i>Long Walks, Cool Bugs, Programming</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Dislikes: <i>Crowds, Other People</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Noki</strong> (Cell Phone)\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Likes: <i>Photography, Gardening, \u201cHarmless\u201d Pranks</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Dislikes: <i>Separation</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Lotte</strong> (Coffee Machine)\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Likes: <i>Live Music, Sewing &amp; Fashion, Helping Friends</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Dislikes: <i>Coffee</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3612670/extras/LS_Explore_to_Increase_Stats.gif?t=1742897019\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">1. Explore the town to increase your stats and build up your deck.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">2. Engage in conversations with your appliances (dates).</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">3. Interact in your world and theirs.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">4. Feel the spark in: Love Surge!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3612670/extras/LS_Convo_with_Appliances.gif?t=1742897019\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Game Features</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Deck builder, dating sim, and visual novel all wrapped into one</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">3 different romanceable characters</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Each character has two different endings</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3612670/extras/LS_Feel_the_Spark.gif?t=1742897019\" /></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3612670?t=1742897019","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3612670/b1eac5eea5cc7f31a952e4fe30e7929e16f617a7/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1742897019","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3612670/b3321c0e619844872bc09847b9a51a66d3c1120a/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1742897019","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3612670/b3321c0e619844872bc09847b9a51a66d3c1120a/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1742897019","categories":[{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3612670/extras/Love_Surge_Intro.gif?t=1742897019\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>About</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Every